description: React wrapper rules for packages/components-react
globs: packages/components-react/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# PDS React

- Keep wrapper behavior aligned with the underlying PDS web component instead of adding React-only divergence by default.
- Use `@porsche-design-system/components-react/ssr` for SSR frameworks and keep `PorscheDesignSystemProvider` requirements intact.
- Pass extra ARIA through the supported `aria` prop rather than ad-hoc host attributes.
- Avoid manual edits to generated `dist/` output unless the task is explicitly about published artifacts.
- Validate wrapper changes with `yarn test:unit:components-react`.
